[yongtang | 2017-06-13T19:20:45Z]
Created a PR #10686 to expose `Flush()` in Python.

Note that in https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/blob/abae4305a6208bde6072d257a6ce734a8d369089/tensorflow/core/lib/io/record_writer.cc#L125-L130
```
Status RecordWriter::Flush() {
  if (IsZlibCompressed(options_)) {
    return dest_->Flush();
  }
  return Status::OK();
}
```

So the `Flush()` is only effective in case of compressed files.

